From 791dede4ba2a3c214b0bfeba5e2a5562d13d4c82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:16:30 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(post): pin the ream on the lathe posts

Post an axial ream on the spindle centreline through each shipped lathe
post. fanuc-lathe writes one G85 with the chain suppressed. tormach-lathe
has no canned cycle and posts the expanded chain: feed in, feed out at
the same F. A dwell stays with the ream. A ream off the spindle axis is
refused by name. One golden for each lathe post. No post script changed.

Fixes #1481

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
